  "limitations": "Requires physical board oscillator/JTAG. Status flags are independent delayed levels, not coherent snapshots or guaranteed short-pulse capture. Final transport reset is inferred from its separately observed operands. AXI payload is sampled only in its own domain. Full AXI profiles require stable UI/XDMA/core clocks for debug communication; use ddr-status-ila when those clocks are absent. No hardware capture has been performed.",
